WEBVTT

00:23.710 --> 00:27.750
<b>DECEMBER, 1989</b>

00:29.750 --> 00:35.340
<b>SORAMAME HOUSE</b>

00:49.980 --> 00:50.980
<b>Oh my.</b>

00:51.570 --> 00:52.570
<b>Oh.</b>

00:53.360 --> 00:55.110
<b>-Hey, look.
-Whoa.</b>

00:55.200 --> 00:58.240
<b>Darling, why don't we adopt all of them?</b>

00:58.320 --> 01:00.620
<b>I wish we could, but…</b>

01:00.700 --> 01:03.000
<b>We are both elderly…</b>

01:03.080 --> 01:04.910
<b>Yes, I know.</b>

01:05.000 --> 01:06.960
<b>Only one.</b>

01:07.040 --> 01:10.000
<b>-Bye bye!
-See you!</b>

01:10.790 --> 01:13.260
<b>Let's come back tomorrow, shall we?</b>

01:13.340 --> 01:14.970
<b>Yes, let's.</b>

01:19.550 --> 01:20.930
<b>Oh!</b>

01:21.010 --> 01:23.060
<b>Be not gone with the wind!</b>

01:28.100 --> 01:29.610
<b>I got it.</b>

01:30.860 --> 01:32.820
<b>Oh!</b>

01:33.650 --> 01:35.490
<b>Oh! Thank you!</b>

01:35.570 --> 01:37.030
<b>I will come for it tomorrow!</b>

01:37.110 --> 01:38.860
<b>Keep it for me, will you?</b>

01:38.950 --> 01:39.910
<b>Yes.</b>

01:42.200 --> 01:45.500
<b><i>Oh my</i>…<i> Have you ever seen</i>
<i>a boy so beautiful?</i></b>

01:45.580 --> 01:47.250
<b>Even so…</b>

01:47.330 --> 01:48.540
<b>Right.</b>

01:48.620 --> 01:51.540
<b>We mustn't choose a child
for his appearance.</b>

01:53.880 --> 01:55.090
<b>Hmm?</b>

01:55.710 --> 01:58.010
<b>It must be an autumn shower.</b>

01:58.090 --> 01:59.510
<b>Dear. Wipers.</b>

01:59.590 --> 02:01.300
<b>Yes.</b>

02:03.100 --> 02:04.180
<b>Oh?</b>

02:14.730 --> 02:17.610
<b>Dear. That child…</b>

02:17.700 --> 02:19.280
<b>Yes…</b>

03:52.080 --> 03:53.120
<b>FEBRUARY, 1990</b>

03:53.210 --> 03:55.460
<b>Finally, the day has come.</b>

03:56.040 --> 03:58.590
<b>It feels like a dream.</b>

03:58.670 --> 04:01.170
<b>To think that
a childless pair like you and me</b>

04:01.260 --> 04:04.300
<b>would become the parents
of a little boy today.</b>

04:07.140 --> 04:08.060
<b>He's here!</b>

04:09.430 --> 04:12.140
<b>Let the three of us become</b>

04:12.230 --> 04:13.890
<b>a happy family.</b>

04:29.870 --> 04:31.500
<b>Whoa…</b>

04:38.130 --> 04:39.840
<b>From today on</b>

04:39.920 --> 04:41.800
<b>this is your room, Hitori.</b>

04:41.880 --> 04:44.010
<b>This is my room?</b>

04:44.090 --> 04:46.930
<b>Is it too childish for a boy your age?</b>

04:47.010 --> 04:50.510
<b>It might have been better
with a different pattern for the bed.</b>

04:50.600 --> 04:51.850
<b>No.</b>

04:51.930 --> 04:54.140
<b>I love stars!</b>

04:54.230 --> 04:56.190
<b>I'm glad.</b>

04:56.270 --> 04:57.940
<b>We can decorate it together</b>

04:58.020 --> 05:00.440
<b>to make it a beautiful room for you.</b>

05:00.520 --> 05:01.400
<b>Yes!</b>

05:02.480 --> 05:04.780
<b>Darling, can you get me a boxcutter?</b>

05:04.860 --> 05:06.410
<b>One moment.</b>

05:06.490 --> 05:11.540
<b>Now where is it… Huh?</b>

05:12.830 --> 05:16.040
<b><i>Did we receive such a big box?</i></b>

05:18.040 --> 05:20.290
<b>-Where did you--
-Uhm!</b>

05:20.380 --> 05:21.630
<b>-Hm?
-Huh?</b>

05:21.710 --> 05:25.420
<b>Would it be okay if I decorated myself?</b>

05:25.510 --> 05:26.510
<b>-Oh.
-Hm.</b>

05:27.590 --> 05:29.350
<b>Why, of course.</b>

05:29.430 --> 05:31.680
<b>You can do whatever you want.</b>

05:31.760 --> 05:34.350
<b>This room is your castle, Hitori.</b>

05:34.430 --> 05:36.060
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

05:36.140 --> 05:40.360
<b>Then we will go downstairs
and start making dinner.</b>

05:40.440 --> 05:43.030
<b>I'll come get you when it's ready.</b>

05:43.110 --> 05:44.030
<b>Yes.</b>

06:12.810 --> 06:14.260
<b>Let's tidy up.</b>

06:14.890 --> 06:15.810
<b>Yes.</b>

06:28.450 --> 06:30.110
<b><i>Hitori.</i></b>

06:35.450 --> 06:36.580
<b>Wow.</b>

06:36.660 --> 06:39.290
<b>-You're done already?
-Yes.</b>

06:39.370 --> 06:41.580
<b>That's incredible.</b>

06:41.670 --> 06:45.050
<b>Right. Dinner will be ready
in just a moment.</b>

06:45.130 --> 06:46.510
<b>Let's go downstairs.</b>

06:46.590 --> 06:48.590
<b>Your mother made so much food</b>

06:48.670 --> 06:51.140
<b>the table is filled to the brink.</b>

06:51.220 --> 06:52.680
<b>It's excessive…</b>

06:53.850 --> 06:54.300
<b>He's gone.</b>

07:07.610 --> 07:10.700
<b>This is the best meal I've ever had.</b>

07:10.780 --> 07:13.160
<b>Oh my, you're so genuine.</b>

07:14.330 --> 07:15.450
<b>Hitori.</b>

07:15.530 --> 07:17.410
<b>How were the clothes we got you?</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:20.330
<b>There were a lot in your room, right?</b>

07:22.080 --> 07:24.130
<b><i>Oh… That's…</i></b>

07:24.210 --> 07:25.790
<b>All of them were too small…</b>

07:25.880 --> 07:28.550
<b>Oh. I'm so sorry.</b>

07:28.630 --> 07:30.920
<b>We will go get new ones for you.</b>

07:31.010 --> 07:34.430
<b>What kind of clothes do you like?</b>

07:34.510 --> 07:36.100
<b>Then…</b>

07:36.180 --> 07:38.350
<b>Two sets of clothes just like these.</b>

07:38.430 --> 07:39.310
<b>No!</b>

07:39.390 --> 07:41.390
<b>You aren't Steve Jobs!</b>

07:41.480 --> 07:43.600
<b>You don't have to hold back, Hitori.</b>

07:43.690 --> 07:46.940
<b>Exactly. Don't you want
to wear different clothes every day?</b>

07:47.020 --> 07:47.980
<b>No.</b>

07:48.900 --> 07:52.740
<b>I feel the most comfortable
in clothes like these ones.</b>

07:52.820 --> 07:54.280
<b>Really?</b>

07:54.370 --> 07:57.740
<b>I'll go to the mall and look for
something like those for you, then.</b>

07:57.830 --> 07:59.700
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

07:59.790 --> 08:03.120
<b>-Eat as much as you can.
-Yes.</b>

08:03.210 --> 08:04.630
<b>Let me help.</b>

08:04.710 --> 08:06.210
<b>Thank you.</b>

08:10.840 --> 08:14.800
<b>-Hitori, you'll be 13 this year, right?
-Yes.</b>

08:14.890 --> 08:16.510
<b>At the orphanage</b>

08:16.600 --> 08:19.260
<b>the others teased me
for being small for my age.</b>

08:19.350 --> 08:23.690
<b>A boy like you
will grow taller in no time.</b>

08:23.770 --> 08:24.770
<b>That's right.</b>

08:24.850 --> 08:27.940
<b>With your mother's food,
you'll grow both taller and wider.</b>

08:28.020 --> 08:31.440
<b>Dear, what do you mean by that?</b>

08:32.190 --> 08:34.820
<b>-Oh, you.
-It's all out of love.</b>

08:38.370 --> 08:40.540
<b>I'm so full.</b>

08:40.620 --> 08:42.040
<b>Darling.</b>

08:42.120 --> 08:44.750
<b>You haven't even touched the jambalaya.</b>

08:44.830 --> 08:47.460
<b>But my dear, you made
too much food tonight.</b>

08:48.210 --> 08:49.670
<b>Even so…</b>

08:49.750 --> 08:51.300
<b>The jambalaya…</b>

08:53.340 --> 08:54.510
<b>Mom.</b>

08:54.590 --> 08:55.470
<b>Huh?</b>

08:58.140 --> 09:00.310
<b>Can I have some jambalaya?</b>

09:03.230 --> 09:04.810
<b>Of course my dear!</b>

09:05.480 --> 09:06.770
<b>I'll do it.</b>

09:06.850 --> 09:07.730
<b>Yes.</b>

09:55.650 --> 09:57.400
<b>Go ahead.</b>

09:57.490 --> 09:59.110
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

10:05.870 --> 10:07.290
<b>Mom.</b>

10:07.370 --> 10:09.380
<b>The jambalaya is amazing!</b>

10:11.380 --> 10:12.880
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

10:12.960 --> 10:14.710
<b>Hitori.</b>

10:24.930 --> 10:27.730
<b>Oh, perfect timing, Hitori.</b>

10:27.810 --> 10:29.850
<b>Could you massage my shoulders for me?</b>

10:29.940 --> 10:32.060
<b>Your… shoulders?</b>

10:33.270 --> 10:36.400
<b>I'll tell you how. Come over here.</b>

10:36.490 --> 10:37.440
<b>Yes.</b>

10:45.040 --> 10:46.500
<b>That's good.</b>

10:46.580 --> 10:48.500
<b>You're doing great.</b>

10:48.580 --> 10:50.420
<b>Now knead instead.</b>

10:50.500 --> 10:51.330
<b>Yes.</b>

10:52.500 --> 10:55.630
<b>That's right. Use your thumbs.</b>

10:57.340 --> 11:00.510
<b>Maybe go back to pummeling in that place.</b>

11:00.590 --> 11:01.470
<b>Yes.</b>

11:03.010 --> 11:04.930
<b>A bit more gentle.</b>

11:06.100 --> 11:08.520
<b>Kneading is better, I think.</b>

11:13.480 --> 11:14.570
<b>Oh…</b>

11:15.690 --> 11:17.690
<b>I'm so sorry, Hitori.</b>

11:17.780 --> 11:20.030
<b>I got carried away.</b>

11:20.110 --> 11:24.620
<b>I always dreamed of
having my son massage my shoulders.</b>

11:24.700 --> 11:26.660
<b>-Me too.
-Oh?</b>

11:26.740 --> 11:29.370
<b>I also dreamed of it.</b>

11:29.460 --> 11:30.910
<b>Really?</b>

11:31.000 --> 11:34.500
<b>Then maybe it is okay
to go on for a bit longer.</b>

11:34.590 --> 11:35.500
<b>Yes.</b>

11:37.170 --> 11:39.130
<b>Pummel, hard.</b>

11:39.210 --> 11:40.800
<b>Now knead</b>

11:42.130 --> 11:43.510
<b>Pummel.</b>

11:44.300 --> 11:45.430
<b>Knead.</b>

11:45.510 --> 11:46.560
<b>Pummel.</b>

11:46.640 --> 11:47.560
<b>Knead.</b>

11:47.640 --> 11:48.770
<b>Knead, pummel.</b>

11:48.850 --> 11:50.430
<b>Pummel, knead.</b>

11:50.520 --> 11:54.610
<b>Wow, Hitori, you're amazing.</b>

11:54.690 --> 11:59.440
<b>Even though I make
so many demands, you adapt so well.</b>

12:00.900 --> 12:03.860
<b>That's a good skill to have.</b>

12:06.450 --> 12:08.580
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:13.830 --> 12:16.210
<b><i>The first day was a success.</i></b>

12:16.790 --> 12:18.590
<b>Don't let your guard down, Migi.</b>

12:18.670 --> 12:20.460
<b>Let us proceed with caution.</b>

12:20.550 --> 12:23.010
<b>No need to lecture me, Dali.</b>

12:23.090 --> 12:25.050
<b>Let us proceed with caution.</b>

12:26.600 --> 12:28.810
<b>As one person.</b>

12:35.440 --> 12:37.020
<b>Here, I guess.</b>

12:38.570 --> 12:39.570
<b>Migi.</b>

12:39.650 --> 12:40.820
<b>Let's stop for now.</b>

12:40.900 --> 12:41.780
<b>Huh?</b>

12:43.780 --> 12:45.410
<b>It's almost morning.</b>

12:47.660 --> 12:49.330
<b>Good morning, Hitori.</b>

12:49.410 --> 12:51.750
<b>Did you sleep well last night?</b>

12:51.830 --> 12:52.710
<b>Yes.</b>

12:52.790 --> 12:54.580
<b>I slept like a rock.</b>

12:54.670 --> 12:55.960
<b>Ah.</b>

12:56.040 --> 12:56.960
<b>Hitori.</b>

12:57.670 --> 13:00.880
<b>You don't have to be so polite to us.</b>

13:00.960 --> 13:03.470
<b>That's right. You're our son, after all.</b>

13:05.930 --> 13:07.760
<b>Yes.
I will do my best.</b>

13:12.270 --> 13:13.230
<b>Hitori seems to</b>

13:13.310 --> 13:17.190
<b>still hold back around us.</b>

13:17.270 --> 13:18.690
<b>It would seem so.</b>

13:18.770 --> 13:22.860
<b>I want to give him as many
childhood memories as I can.</b>

13:22.940 --> 13:25.820
<b>Like baking a cherry pie with his mother.</b>

13:25.900 --> 13:29.030
<b>Or riding on his father's shoulders.</b>

13:30.080 --> 13:31.040
<b>Huh?</b>

13:31.120 --> 13:32.790
<b>Darling,</b>

13:32.870 --> 13:34.960
<b>the one who wants to do that is you.</b>

13:35.040 --> 13:37.330
<b>-Same goes for you.
-What?</b>

13:41.920 --> 13:42.920
<b>I found it.</b>

13:43.010 --> 13:44.210
<b>It's this one.</b>

13:51.010 --> 13:52.310
<b>Mom.</b>

13:53.390 --> 13:54.520
<b>Oh, Hitori.</b>

13:55.730 --> 13:58.400
<b>Can I sit next to you and read too?</b>

13:58.480 --> 14:00.650
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

14:02.980 --> 14:03.980
<b>Whoa.</b>

14:04.070 --> 14:06.700
<b>Cherry pie looks so delicious.</b>

14:07.280 --> 14:09.200
<b>I hope I can try one someday.</b>

14:12.410 --> 14:13.830
<b>But I'm sure</b>

14:13.910 --> 14:16.040
<b>this kind of food</b>

14:16.120 --> 14:17.870
<b>only exists in my dreams.</b>

14:19.790 --> 14:22.420
<b>-It's real!
-Oh?</b>

14:23.050 --> 14:26.550
<b>How about you and I
make a cherry pie?</b>

14:27.470 --> 14:30.930
<b>Now turn the dough while rolling it out.</b>

14:31.010 --> 14:33.060
<b>Oh, it's getting round.</b>

14:33.970 --> 14:36.640
<b>It's easy if you just remember the steps.</b>

14:36.730 --> 14:38.350
<b>I memorized them already.</b>

14:38.440 --> 14:40.230
<b>Oho.
Really?</b>

14:40.310 --> 14:43.520
<b>-What flour do you use for dusting?
-Bread flour.</b>

14:43.610 --> 14:46.280
<b>-You preheat the oven at how many degrees?
-200 degrees.</b>

14:46.360 --> 14:48.950
<b>-What do you use to gather the seeds?
-A dough scraper.</b>

14:49.030 --> 14:51.070
<b>You're such a fast learner!</b>

14:51.160 --> 14:54.030
<b>Only because you are so good at teaching.</b>

14:56.830 --> 14:59.790
<b>Okay, now.
I'll start braiding the pie crust.</b>

14:59.870 --> 15:02.750
<b>First you lay it down horizontally,</b>

15:02.840 --> 15:04.800
<b>then skipping one, you bend…</b>

15:04.880 --> 15:06.090
<b>Bend… Bend and…</b>

15:06.170 --> 15:07.550
<b>No, that's not right.</b>

15:09.630 --> 15:10.720
<b>Shit!</b>

15:10.800 --> 15:12.590
<b>I'm bad at switching back and forth!</b>

15:12.680 --> 15:16.180
<b>I get so confused as to which is which.</b>

15:19.940 --> 15:23.110
<b>Yes, I'm coming!</b>

15:30.610 --> 15:32.780
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

15:36.370 --> 15:37.330
<b>Wow!</b>

15:37.410 --> 15:39.870
<b>It wasn't hard for you at all!</b>

15:43.420 --> 15:44.590
<b>You know,</b>

15:44.670 --> 15:48.510
<b>I always dreamed of
making cherry pies with my child.</b>

15:48.590 --> 15:51.260
<b>Was it just like you'd hoped?</b>

15:51.340 --> 15:52.340
<b>No.</b>

15:52.430 --> 15:53.930
<b>The reality…</b>

15:55.100 --> 15:58.060
<b>…was both faster
and more fun than I thought!</b>

15:59.220 --> 16:00.230
<b>Me too.</b>

16:01.600 --> 16:02.900
<b>I had fun!</b>

16:04.310 --> 16:05.860
<b>Hitori.</b>

16:08.780 --> 16:10.320
<b>Mom.</b>

16:10.940 --> 16:12.150
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:27.040 --> 16:29.550
<b>What's wrong, Hitori?</b>

16:30.210 --> 16:31.340
<b>Dad.</b>

16:31.420 --> 16:33.430
<b>I wanted to put up the birdhouse,</b>

16:33.510 --> 16:36.470
<b>but I'm too short to reach.</b>

16:37.970 --> 16:40.850
<b>That's… quite tricky.</b>

16:41.850 --> 16:44.440
<b>If only I was a little taller…</b>

16:45.400 --> 16:48.020
<b>If I was tall…</b>

16:50.150 --> 16:52.070
<b>-Hitori.
-Huh?</b>

16:52.150 --> 16:54.860
<b>How about you ride on my shoulders?</b>

16:55.410 --> 16:56.660
<b>Or maybe…?</b>

16:59.280 --> 17:03.040
<b>-Hold on firm to my head.
-Yes.</b>

17:04.750 --> 17:06.630
<b><i>I hope he'll remember this day</i></b>

17:06.710 --> 17:10.170
<b><i>as a beautiful memory.</i></b>

17:12.090 --> 17:13.130
<b>One.</b>

17:13.220 --> 17:14.340
<b>Two…</b>

17:14.970 --> 17:15.800
<b>Three!</b>

17:15.880 --> 17:17.680
<b>To the sky!</b>

17:20.890 --> 17:22.810
<b>Sheesh, Dear.</b>

17:22.890 --> 17:25.230
<b>What on Earth were you doing?</b>

17:25.310 --> 17:26.560
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

17:26.650 --> 17:27.770
<b>It's because…</b>

17:27.860 --> 17:29.110
<b>I was too heavy…</b>

17:29.190 --> 17:31.730
<b>That's not true, Hitori.</b>

17:31.820 --> 17:32.820
<b>It's me.</b>

17:32.900 --> 17:35.030
<b>I'm too weak.</b>

17:35.110 --> 17:36.490
<b>It's fine.</b>

17:36.570 --> 17:37.950
<b>I'll just rest for a bit.</b>

17:38.030 --> 17:41.660
<b>Then you can ride my shoulders.</b>

17:41.740 --> 17:43.040
<b>Dad.</b>

17:45.040 --> 17:47.040
<b>Can you believe that senile man?</b>

17:47.710 --> 17:48.920
<b>And old man like him</b>

17:49.000 --> 17:52.130
<b>obviously can't carry us.</b>

17:52.210 --> 17:53.050
<b>And yet.</b>

17:53.130 --> 17:56.180
<b>If he doesn't lift us up,
the plan will fail.</b>

17:59.800 --> 18:01.930
<b>Migi.
I have a good idea.</b>

18:02.010 --> 18:02.850
<b>Dali.</b>

18:02.930 --> 18:04.640
<b>So do I.</b>

18:06.480 --> 18:08.020
<b>Okay, let's do it.</b>

18:08.100 --> 18:09.020
<b>Wait, please.</b>

18:09.100 --> 18:10.360
<b>I'm still not</b>

18:10.440 --> 18:11.980
<b>ready to try…</b>

18:12.070 --> 18:13.730
<b><i>Hitori.</i></b>

18:13.820 --> 18:15.440
<b><i>Me neither.</i></b>

18:17.200 --> 18:20.450
<b><i>I'm also not ready just yet.</i></b>

18:21.990 --> 18:25.120
<b><i>But I cannot fail again.</i></b>

18:26.000 --> 18:27.460
<b><i>I have one try.</i></b>

18:28.620 --> 18:29.670
<b><i>Prepare yourself…</i></b>

18:29.750 --> 18:31.630
<b><i>…and do it!</i></b>

18:34.420 --> 18:35.710
<b>I'm ready!</b>

18:37.510 --> 18:38.680
<b><i>Let's go.</i></b>

18:39.640 --> 18:40.640
<b>One.</b>

18:40.720 --> 18:42.600
<b>Two, and…</b>

18:42.680 --> 18:44.010
<b>three!</b>

18:51.310 --> 18:52.400
<b>I did it.</b>

18:52.480 --> 18:53.980
<b>It's a success.</b>

18:54.690 --> 18:56.320
<b>Now, the bird box…</b>

18:58.740 --> 18:59.860
<b>I put it up.</b>

18:59.950 --> 19:01.240
<b>You did?</b>

19:01.320 --> 19:02.490
<b>You're quick.</b>

19:02.570 --> 19:04.830
<b>Show me, will you?</b>

19:08.410 --> 19:11.000
<b>What's wrong, Hitori?</b>

19:11.960 --> 19:13.750
<b>Are you afraid of heights?</b>

19:14.920 --> 19:15.750
<b>Yes.</b>

19:15.840 --> 19:16.840
<b>I'm scared.</b>

19:18.800 --> 19:20.180
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

19:20.260 --> 19:21.970
<b>You're scared.</b>

19:26.020 --> 19:27.060
<b>Dad.</b>

19:27.140 --> 19:28.390
<b>Yes?</b>

19:32.440 --> 19:33.610
<b>Thank you.</b>

19:37.150 --> 19:38.570
<b>Hitori…</b>

19:39.190 --> 19:40.740
<b>So far so good.</b>

19:40.820 --> 19:43.530
<b>Everything is exactly as we wanted.</b>

19:44.990 --> 19:47.120
<b>We've won that old couple over well.</b>

19:47.790 --> 19:49.750
<b>And we made new discoveries.</b>

19:50.290 --> 19:54.290
<b>We can make our body weight become zero.</b>

19:54.380 --> 19:56.840
<b>And the old man has a bad back.</b>

19:56.920 --> 19:59.880
<b>The back of his head smells musty.</b>

19:59.970 --> 20:02.380
<b>She has a short temper.</b>

20:02.470 --> 20:04.890
<b><i>And cherry pie is delicious.</i></b>

20:05.430 --> 20:06.600
<b><i>And…</i></b>

21:40.070 --> 21:44.070
<b>SORAMAME HOUSE</b>

21:42.650 --> 21:44.070
<b><i>Did you hear?</i></b>

21:44.390 --> 21:47.680
<b>Next week, someone will
come looking for a kid.</b>

21:47.680 --> 21:49.280
<b>-Really?
-Yeah!</b>

21:49.280 --> 21:52.400
<b><i>They said it's a couple</i>
<i>from Origon Village.</i></b>

21:52.400 --> 21:53.670
<b><i>Origon Village?</i></b>

21:53.670 --> 21:55.530
<b><i>That means they're wealthy!</i></b>

21:55.530 --> 21:56.620
<b><i>But</i></b>

21:56.620 --> 21:59.290
<b><i>they're only looking for one child.</i></b>

21:59.290 --> 22:00.670
<b><i>One…</i></b>

22:05.440 --> 22:07.970
<b>We have waited forever for this day.</b>

22:10.210 --> 22:11.910
<b>Origon Village…</b>

22:18.520 --> 22:20.400
<b>Hey, me too!</b>

22:23.010 --> 22:24.820
<b>Dali. This is bad.</b>

22:25.270 --> 22:27.380
<b>They'll end up choosing the chubster.</b>

22:27.810 --> 22:29.660
<b>Don't be so worried, Migi.</b>

22:30.020 --> 22:31.150
<b>We will</b>

22:31.150 --> 22:33.580
<b>leave a strong impression at the end.</b>

22:38.610 --> 22:39.480
<b>How is it?</b>

22:42.120 --> 22:43.000
<b>They're here.</b>

22:48.160 --> 22:49.760
<b>Okay. I caught it.</b>

22:53.580 --> 22:54.850
<b>I got it.</b>

23:01.840 --> 23:03.110
<b>-Okay.
-Next!</b>

23:07.260 --> 23:08.200
<b>Now!</b>

23:28.110 --> 23:29.200
<b>Child.</b>

23:29.200 --> 23:30.330
<b>What is your name?</b>

23:32.150 --> 23:32.910
<b>My name</b>

23:36.270 --> 23:37.300
<b>is Hitori.</b>

23:37.300 --> 23:39.300
<b></b>
